          "indent": 0,
          "line_start": 10,
          "page_start": 1,
          "page_end": 1,
          "text": "any transaction, referred to in any other section under Chapter VIII 20[], to which provisions of section 140(9) or (13) of this Act or section 80-IA(8) or (10) of the Income-tax Act, 1961 (43 of 1961) are applicable;",
